 --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0001_closure_in_let/main.vr:2:18
  |
2 |     let double = |n| n * 2;
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^ a closure can only be the argument of a call that takes one: `map` on an `Option`, `map_err` on a `Result`, and `map`, `filter`, `any`, `all`, and `find` on a chain
